{"version":1,"content":"<p>【不會吧 😭】想不到吧 !! 開源作業系統 Alpine Linux 官方近日發布資安通告，證實其內部運作的 GitLab 伺服器遭受「滿分」CVSS 10.0 極危漏洞（CVE-2026-97229）的惡意攻擊。</p><p>由於部分日誌被覆蓋，無法排除是否已被植入惡意代碼，官方決定將整座 GitLab 實體徹底銷毀並從零重建，同時強制重設全體用戶密碼與金鑰。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:46:21.450987+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:26:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:18:59.145720+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:39:42.393712+00:00","content_hash":"62c262d342680433af88c38aee2fdf71eb329eb7407d4a1dc8927d32007d9167","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}